          F1i: FHS-joint twin of B2i (the print geometry, src/nodeJoint.py, instead of cylinders + joint spheres; gmsh tets from the FHS STL, C3D10M h 0.3 mm, distortion control, T 3 ms). ONE C4 unit cell, GRADED radii (Midplane: top 1.0, bottom 0.6, mid 0.8) as a SOLID (C3D10M, h 0.3 mm), bottom clamped, top tied to a rigid plate with the impactor (45 N mm at 6 m/s); linear elastic E = 40 MPa, nu 0.49; frictionless self-contact. Ours: beams (0.6 mm elements), fused-section joint model                                
